{"ID":"20240314094838-254nd6k","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314094838-254nd6k","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314094838-254nd6k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171727-7ip90e1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171727-ffh2soa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171727-ffh2soa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:113,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:113\u0026#125;","title":"【枳实栀子豉汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171735"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171727-7ip90e1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171727-7ip90e1","updated":"20240422171727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大病差后，劳复者，枳实栀子豉汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171727-xtlo5pe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171727-xtlo5pe","updated":"20240422171727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实栀子豉汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171727-6664cq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171727-6664cq9","updated":"20240422171727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实三枚炙栀子十四枚香豉一升緜裹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171727-9vzj8q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171727-9vzj8q8","updated":"20240422171727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以清浆水七升，空煑取四升，纳枳实栀子，煑取二升，下豉，更煑五六沸，去滓，温分再服，覆令微似汗，若有宿食者，内大黄如博碁子大五六枚，服之愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171727-s4vvtl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171727-s4vvtl0","updated":"20240422171727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"现在讲这个大病好了呢，你要怎么调理它？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"劳复者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"什么意思？这个人大病初愈，病刚刚好恢复，结果呢，他就要去做劳力的工作。有的人很勤快啊！好久没有去砍草了，好久没有整理房子去油漆了，现在生病好不容易好了，好了他就去工作。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"工作一过度，结果病会复发哦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"劳病。因为劳而得到的病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实栀子豆豉汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这三味药呢，这个豆豉把它包起来，因为豆豉一煮就散开来啦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171727-kaziblk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171727-kaziblk","updated":"20240422171727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煮的方法呢，诸位看哦。先清浆水哦，过去水不干净，你们不用去计较这些了，直接用自来水去煮。比如说这个，先放枳实在里面煮，比如，四碗水煮成两碗。然后再下豆豉，因为枳实不容易煮嘛，豆豉一下就煮熟了，所以先拿枳实跟栀子去煮，四碗煮成两碗，再把豆豉放下去煮，滚一下就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171727-ffh2soa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171727-ffh2soa","updated":"20240422171727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"取一点点汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为这个病人已经恢复啦，是因为过劳才复发的，过劳后身体里面津液丧失一点。那又不是很严重的丧失津液，所以你只要一点点就可以了。那如果病人有宿食，就是大便有堵到这种现象，那你可以加一点点大黄，这种是病后调理的处方。"}]}]}